#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:1
msgid "文档包、发布与独立恢复"
msgstr "Documentation packages, publication and independent restoration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:3
msgid ""
"本页说明 `tools/documentation/delivery.py` 的交付合同。目标是让同一份文档可以在线 "
"阅读、离线阅读并从归档独立恢复，同时保留准确的源码和软件验证身份。文档交付 不增加固件测试资格，不代表物理 HIL、产品发布、安全认证或长期支持承诺。"
msgstr ""
"This page defines the delivery contract of "
"`tools/documentation/delivery.py`. The same documentation must be readable "
"online and offline and independently restorable from its archive, while "
"preserving exact source and software-verification identities. Documentation "
"delivery grants no new firmware qualification and establishes neither "
"physical HIL, product release, safety certification nor long-term support."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:7
msgid "输入与身份"
msgstr "Inputs and identity"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:9
msgid "交付输入是严格构建后的 HTML 根目录和当前 Git 源码。构建根必须包含："
msgstr ""
"Delivery consumes the strictly built HTML root and the current Git source. "
"The build root must contain:"

