msgstr "`documentation-build.json`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:0
msgid "构建时观测的源码和工具身份"
msgstr "Source and tool identities observed during the build"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:20
msgid ""
"本地图源、SVG、CSS、JavaScript、字体、下载说明和其他许可随实际构建产物一起登记。 网页资源使用相对路径，不能依赖在线 CDN。正常的 "
"HTTP(S) 参考链接可以保留；离线 阅读的页面、脚本、样式和图片必须已经在包中。"
msgstr ""
"Local diagram sources, SVG, CSS, JavaScript, fonts, download instructions "
"and other licenses are inventoried with the actual build output. Web "
"resources use relative paths and cannot depend on an online CDN. Normal "
"HTTP(S) reference links may remain; pages, scripts, styles and images needed"
" for offline reading must already be in the package."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:24
msgid ""
"构建记录采用 schema 1，`kind` 为 `nexus_documentation_build`。其 `source` 使用 "
"`tools.evidence.identity.observe_git_source()` 的实际观测结果，`tools` 保存实际工具 "
"版本，`languages` 固定为 `en`、`zh_CN`。交付工具拒绝脏源码、缺失或偏离锁定版本 的 "
"submodule，以及与当前源码不一致的陈旧构建。"
msgstr ""
"The build record uses schema 1 and `kind` `nexus_documentation_build`. Its "
"`source` contains actual observations from "
"`tools.evidence.identity.observe_git_source()`, `tools` records observed "
"tool versions, and `languages` is fixed to `en` and `zh_CN`. Delivery "
"rejects dirty source, missing or mismatched pinned submodules, and stale "
"builds that do not match the current source."

msgid ""
"版本号由既有严格 policy loader 从 `dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` 读取， "
"该 JSON 是唯一人工维护的版本权威。CMake 调用同一 loader 派生版本，不从 `project(nexus VERSION "
"...)` 文本反向推断版本。manifest 同时记录该 policy 的摘要、 接口 epoch 和 schema "
"epochs；版本不一致、重复 JSON 键和非法常量均拒绝。 版本身份另外使用 明确的 `release_id`；格式示例为 "
"`1.0.0-docs-g<commit>`，不表示当前平台版本。 这个身份只允许字母、数字、点、 下划线和短横线，不能携带目录或 URL。"
msgstr ""
"The existing strict policy loader reads the version from "
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json`, which is the sole authored "
"version authority. CMake calls the same loader to derive the version "
"rather than inferring it from the `project(nexus VERSION ...)` text. The"
" manifest also records the policy digest, interface epoch and schema "
"epochs; inconsistent versions, duplicate JSON keys and invalid constants"
" are rejected. A separate explicit `release_id` identifies the release; "
"`1.0.0-docs-g<commit>` is a format example and does not imply the "
"current platform version. This identity permits only letters, digits, "
"dots, underscores and hyphens, and cannot contain a directory or URL."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:36
msgid "manifest 分开记录三类身份："
msgstr "The manifest distinguishes three identities:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:38
msgid "`documentation_source`：构建时完整 commit／tree 和文档目录的限定树摘要。"
msgstr ""
"`documentation_source`: the full build-time commit/tree and the scoped tree "
"digest of documentation directories."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:39
msgid "`code_source`：同一 checkout 的完整 commit／tree 和平台代码目录的限定树摘要。"
msgstr ""
"`code_source`: the full commit/tree of the same checkout and the scoped tree"
" digest of platform code directories."

msgid ""
"`qualification_references[]`：显式选入的原候选；每项保留自身源码、配置摘要、 ELF／BIN／map "
"摘要及字节数、六个 qualified scopes 和候选文件身份。"
msgstr ""
"`qualification_references[]`: explicitly selected original candidates; "
"each retains its own source, configuration digest, ELF/BIN/map digests "
"and sizes, six qualified scopes and candidate file identity."

msgid ""
"前两项可能来自同一 Git 提交，但覆盖的目录不同。schema 2 的第三项是显式列表， "
"默认没有引用；不再从固定历史结果索引推断资格。每份候选必须先通过现有 "
"`tools.evidence.candidate.verified_projection()` 的完整原件校验；缺失或篡改原件、 "
"重复候选与非法 scope 在输出前拒绝。不同候选保持各自源码、配置及产物身份， 不能合并成全平台通过。`physical_status` "
"固定为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"The first two identities may come from the same Git commit but cover "
"different directories. The third identity in schema 2 is an explicit "
"list, empty by default; qualification is no longer inferred from a fixed"
" historical result index. Each candidate must first pass the existing "
"`tools.evidence.candidate.verified_projection()` verification of the "
"complete original closure; missing or tampered originals, duplicate "
"candidates and invalid scopes are rejected before output. Different "
"candidates keep their own source, configuration and artifact identities;"
" they cannot be merged into a whole-platform pass. `physical_status` "
"remains `not_executed`."

msgid ""
"文档包只保存已校验的精简引用，不复制候选配置、源码 SDK 或大型原始日志。 离线 `verify()` "
"校验该引用的结构和被封存字节，不重新校验未随包复制的候选闭包， 也不赋予当前 HEAD 新软件资格。原 candidate locator "
"是原主机位置，不是下载 URL。 若需要重新确认软件候选，必须取回原件并运行原 candidate verifier。 每项 "
"`verification.at_packaging` 为 `original_candidate_closure`， "
"`verification.offline` 为 `reference_metadata_only`， "
"`verification.original_evidence_included` 为 `false`；离线包不伪报原件重验成功。"
msgstr ""
"The documentation package retains only verified compact references, "
"without copying candidate configurations, source SDKs or large raw logs."
" Offline `verify()` checks the structure and sealed bytes of those "
"references; it does not reverify the candidate closure omitted from the "
"package or grant new software qualification to the current HEAD. The "
"original candidate locator identifies a location on the original host, "
"not a download URL. To recheck a software candidate, recover its "
"originals and run the original candidate verifier. Each entry sets "
"`verification.at_packaging` to `original_candidate_closure`, "
"`verification.offline` to `reference_metadata_only`, and "
"`verification.original_evidence_included` to `false`; an offline package"
" does not falsely report successful reverification of originals."

msgid ""
"旧 schema 1 包仅保留只读验证／恢复，仍按原 `qualified_code` 字段解释。 新打包只产生 schema "
"2，不能把旧索引身份默认为新交付的受测代码。"
msgstr ""
"Historical schema 1 packages retain only read-only "
"verification/restoration and are interpreted using their original "
"`qualified_code`. New packaging produces schema 2 only; a historical "
"index identity cannot implicitly become the tested code of a new "
"delivery."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:45
msgid "文件与摘要合同"
msgstr "File and digest contract"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:47
msgid ""
"`documentation-manifest.json` 的 `files` 只列实际 payload，每项包含标准化相对路径、 字节数和 "
"SHA-256。manifest、`SHA256SUMS`、归档本身及执行 receipt 不进入这个表， 避免摘要自引用。`SHA256SUMS` "
"覆盖 payload 和 manifest，也不包含自己。"
msgstr ""
"`files` in `documentation-manifest.json` lists only actual payload. Each "
"entry contains a normalized relative path, byte count and SHA-256. The "
"manifest, `SHA256SUMS`, archive itself and execution receipts are excluded "
"to avoid digest self-reference. `SHA256SUMS` covers payload and manifest, "
"but not itself."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:51
msgid ""
"manifest 摘要和归档摘要由交付命令返回，保存在包外的执行证据及远程发布记录中。 独立恢复时传入保存的 manifest 摘要；这能检测 "
"payload 和 manifest 是否偏离原交付。 摘要校验不是签名，不能认证作者或抵抗已经控制全部信任来源的攻击者。"
msgstr ""
"Delivery commands return manifest and archive digests, retained outside the "
"package in execution evidence and remote publication records. Independent "
"restoration receives the saved manifest digest to detect changes to the "
"payload or manifest. Digest verification is not a signature: it cannot "
"authenticate authors or defeat an attacker controlling every trust source."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:55
msgid ""
"构建 metadata 的 `status` 必须为 `passed`。`failed`、`running`、缺失状态和陈旧 "
"成功记录不能装包；即使手工重算 manifest 与摘要，独立验证仍拒绝失败构建记录。"
msgstr ""
"Build metadata must have `status` `passed`. `failed`, `running`, missing "
"status and stale successful records cannot be packaged. Independent "
"verification still rejects a failed build record even if someone manually "
"recalculates the manifest and digests."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:58
msgid "验证同时检查："
msgstr "Verification also checks:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:60
msgid "manifest schema、源码身份、语言、工具记录和软件资格引用是否完整。"
msgstr ""
"Completeness of manifest schema, source identity, languages, tool records "
"and software qualification references."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:61
msgid "文件闭包是否精确；缺失文件、额外文件、重复记录、摘要或字节数不符均拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"An exact file closure: missing or extra files, duplicate entries, digest "
"mismatches and byte-count mismatches reject."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:62
msgid "必需入口和许可是否存在；页面、资源、anchor 是否可在包内找到。"
msgstr ""
"Required entries and licenses, with pages, resources and anchors resolvable "
"within the package."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:63
msgid "路径是否标准化；绝对路径、目录逃逸、symlink、tar hardlink 和重复成员均拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Normalized paths: absolute paths, directory escape, symlinks, tar hardlinks "
"and duplicate members reject."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:64
msgid "归档是否只包含正常文件，数量和总字节数是否超过工具上限。"
msgstr ""
"Only regular archive files, with member count and total bytes within tool "
"limits."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:66
msgid "装包与恢复"
msgstr "Packaging and restoration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:68
msgid ""
"`package()` 在独立临时目录完成验证、文件复制和归档，再安装到新的输出路径。 输出目录不能与源码或输入 payload 重叠；发布 "
"webroot 也不能包含输入包，或位于 输入包内部。拒绝必须发生在写入前，避免污染被绑定的输入字节。 过程前后再次检查源码和构建 "
"payload，拒绝并发修改。同一份已验证输入产生相同 tar.gz 字节；归档文件顺序、时间、拥有者和文件模式固定。"
msgstr ""
"`package()` verifies, copies and archives in an independent temporary "
"directory before installing into a fresh output path. Output cannot overlap "
"source or input payload; publication webroot cannot contain the input "
"package or sit inside it. Reject before writing so bound input bytes remain "
"untouched. Source and build payload are rechecked before and after the "
"operation to reject concurrent changes. Identical verified inputs produce "
"identical tar.gz bytes; archive order, timestamps, owners and modes are "
"fixed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:74
msgid ""
"`restore()` 先验证归档所有成员和文件闭包，再写入新的独立目录。不会使用 "
"`extractall()`，不会覆盖已有目录，失败不会留下半恢复的目标。恢复目录不需要原 Git checkout、Python "
"虚拟环境或网络即可使用浏览器打开 HTML；执行校验需要该工具。"
msgstr ""
"`restore()` verifies every archive member and the exact file closure before "
"writing into a fresh independent directory. It does not use `extractall()`, "
"overwrite an existing directory or leave a partially restored destination on"
" failure. Restored HTML can be opened in a browser without the original Git "
"checkout, Python virtual environment or network; executing verification "
"requires the tool."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:78
msgid "Python 调用接口如下，CLI 入口由统一 docs 命令提供："
msgstr ""
"The Python interface is below; the unified docs command provides the CLI "
"entry:"

msgid ""
"CLI 的 `--qualification-reference /path/to/candidate.json` 可重复使用，逐项核对 "
"不同精确候选；不提供该选项时保存空列表。显式引用原件缺失时应修复定位或明确 不选入，工具不会悄悄降级为已验证引用。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI option `--qualification-reference /path/to/candidate.json` may "
"be repeated to verify each distinct exact candidate. Without this option"
" an empty list is retained. If an explicitly referenced original is "
"missing, correct its locator or explicitly omit it; the tool does not "
"silently downgrade it to a verified reference."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:91
msgid "这是接口说明片段，路径由调用方显式提供；可执行命令和实际验收结果以统一 docs CLI 及其本次交付 receipt 为准。"
msgstr ""
"This is an interface fragment with paths explicitly supplied by the caller. "
"Executable commands and actual acceptance results come from the unified docs"
" CLI and this delivery's receipts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:94
msgid "旧书签与版本边界"
msgstr "Legacy bookmarks and version boundaries"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:96
msgid ""
"`docs/reference/redirects.csv` 是旧 URL 迁移的唯一人工维护输入。每行明确旧地址、 目标页、来源文档与固定 "
"revision，并选择历史合同边界或同一当前合同的位置迁移。 禁止把旧 HAL／OSAL／Kconfig API "
"当成当前接口，也不能把同合同的位置变化描述为 API 变化。旧地址保留在台账中；后续调整同时检查来源、目标及实际书签行为。"
msgstr ""
"`docs/reference/redirects.csv` is the sole authored input for legacy URL "
"migration. Each row names the old address, target page, source document and "
"fixed revision, and chooses either a historical contract boundary or a "
"location change of the same current contract. Never treat legacy "
"HAL/OSAL/Kconfig APIs as current interfaces, or describe a location-only "
"move as an API change. Keep old addresses in the ledger; subsequent changes "
"check source, destination and actual bookmark behavior together."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:101
msgid ""
"正式双语构建使用 `install_alias_catalog()` 验证这份 CSV，生成包内说明页和 `documentation-"
"aliases.json`。catalog 是派生文件，记录原 CSV 摘要并进入 manifest payload；不能单独手写另一份 alias "
"配置。单语言开发预览不生成完整 catalog，也 不能作为正式双语包。没有 catalog 的历史测试夹具仍可验证，不建立旧 URL 验收。"
msgstr ""
"The formal bilingual build validates this CSV through "
"`install_alias_catalog()` and generates packaged explanation pages plus "
"`documentation-aliases.json`. The catalog is derived, records the original "
"CSV digest and enters the manifest payload; do not author a separate alias "
"configuration. Single-language development previews lack a complete catalog "
"and cannot be formal bilingual packages. Historical test fixtures without a "
"catalog remain verifiable but do not establish legacy URL acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:106
msgid ""
"旧 URL 恰好与新正文路径同名时，生成器保留版本目录中的当前正文，派生 `canonical_collisions` 记录对应当前源路径／摘要和 "
"HTML 摘要。必须存在真实当前 源文件及 HTML，不能用手填标记绕过一致性检查。根目录仍按原 CSV 语义提供说明。 当前 "
"`development/index.html`、`tutorials/index.html` 的两语言页面各有这种同名情况。"
msgstr ""
"When an old URL collides with a current prose path, the generator preserves "
"current prose in the version directory and derives `canonical_collisions` "
"with the corresponding current source path/digest and HTML digest. Real "
"current source and HTML must exist; handwritten markers cannot bypass "
"consistency checks. The site root still explains the original CSV semantics."
" Both languages currently have such collisions for `development/index.html` "
"and `tutorials/index.html`."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:111
msgid ""
"发布除保留不可变 `versions/<release_id>/` 外，还在站点根生成旧书签说明页。 `en/index.html` 和 "
"`zh_CN/index.html` 明确引向当前版本；根 `api/index.html` 说明 旧 API "
"合同并引导阅读历史版本边界，不自动跳转或默默解释为当前公共 API。 当前台账有 287 个旧地址，加上三个语言／API 总入口，共验证 290 个根 "
"gateway。 所有链接都是相对地址，不使用脚本、meta refresh 或外部跳转服务。"
msgstr ""
"Publication preserves immutable `versions/<release_id>/` and generates "
"legacy bookmark explanation pages at the site root. `en/index.html` and "
"`zh_CN/index.html` explicitly point to the current version; root "
"`api/index.html` explains the legacy API contract and directs readers to its"
" historical boundary, without automatic redirection or silently presenting "
"current APIs. The current ledger contains 287 legacy addresses plus three "
"language/API entries, yielding 290 verified root gateways. All links are "
"relative, without scripts, meta refresh or external redirect services."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:117
msgid ""
"未知字段或语义、重复／非标准 URL、保留命名空间、目标缺失、alias 链、语言或 来源语义不一致均在写入前拒绝。已有无关页面、symlink "
"和父目录冲突不能覆盖。 根 `documentation-gateways.json` 只登记工具生成的说明页及入口摘要；重新发布前 "
"核对已登记字节，外部修改需维护者明确处理。该记录在包外，不进入自身摘要闭包， 没有数字签名，不能证明发布者身份，也不能授予实板或 HIL 验证资格。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown fields or semantics, duplicate/noncanonical URLs, reserved "
"namespaces, missing targets, alias chains, and inconsistent language or "
"source semantics reject before writing. Unrelated existing pages, symlinks "
"and parent-directory conflicts cannot be overwritten. Root `documentation-"
"gateways.json` inventories only tool-generated explanation pages and entry "
"digests; registered bytes are checked before republication, and external "
"changes require explicit maintainer handling. This record lives outside the "
"package and its own digest closure, is unsigned, cannot authenticate a "
"publisher, and grants no board or HIL qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:123
msgid ""
"`post_deploy()` 对当前发布版本逐个真实读取全部根 alias 与三个语言／API 入口， 核对源 catalog "
"派生的准确字节。版本目录里的说明页成功，不代替站点根书签验收。 检查历史不可变版本并显式关闭 stable 验收时，receipt 如实记录根 "
"gateway 未检查。"
msgstr ""
"For the current published version, `post_deploy()` actually reads every root"
" alias and all three language/API entries and checks exact bytes derived "
"from the source catalog. Successful version-directory explanation pages do "
"not replace root-bookmark acceptance. When checking an immutable historical "
"version with stable verification explicitly disabled, the receipt truthfully"
" records that root gateways were not checked."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:127
msgid "不可变发布与 stable"
msgstr "Immutable publication and stable"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:129
msgid ""
"`publish()` 将已验证的目录安装到 `<webroot>/versions/<release_id>/`，然后更新 "
"`<webroot>/stable/index.html`。stable 的中英文和 API 入口使用 `../versions/.../` "
"相对链接，不改变被引用版本的内容。显式传入 `archive` 后，归档保存到包外的 "
"`<webroot>/downloads/<release_id>.tar.gz`。stable 显示下载链接和归档摘要，根入口和 "
"下载索引使用相对链接；同名归档也不能替换为不同字节。"
msgstr ""
"`publish()` installs the verified directory at "
"`<webroot>/versions/<release_id>/`, then updates "
"`<webroot>/stable/index.html`. The stable English, Chinese and API entries "
"use relative `../versions/.../` links without altering the selected version."
" When `archive` is supplied explicitly, the archive is stored outside the "
"package at `<webroot>/downloads/<release_id>.tar.gz`. Stable displays the "
"download link and archive digest; root entries and download indexes use "
"relative links. An archive of the same name cannot be replaced with "
"different bytes."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:135
msgid ""
"同一个 `release_id` 已存在时，工具必须验证其 manifest 和全部 payload。只有原 "
"字节完全相同才能重复执行；相同身份但不同字节的发布会被拒绝。新内容使用新身份， "
"不能通过覆盖旧版本消除历史证据。预览构建与发布权限分离，不把预览自动提升为 stable，也不把文档版本当作软件候选状态机。"
msgstr ""
"If a `release_id` already exists, the tool verifies its manifest and entire "
"payload. Repetition is allowed only for identical original bytes; the same "
"identity with different bytes rejects. New content receives a new identity, "
"never an overwritten historical version. Preview builds and publication "
"permissions remain separate; previews do not automatically become stable, "
"and documentation versions are not software-candidate state machines."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:147
msgid ""
"发布后的验收必须访问实际站点 URL。`post_deploy()` 通过 HTTP(S) 读取 manifest、 校验文件以及每个登记的 "
"payload，检查与包外保存摘要的一致性，并验证实际下载 字节和包内链接。默认检查 stable 是否选择本次版本；传入归档摘要时，还检查下载 "
"入口及实际下载归档的完整闭包。命令成功后写入独立 receipt，逐条记录请求 URL、 最终 URL、状态、字节数和摘要。本地 HTTP "
"验证不替代公网验收。"
msgstr ""
"Post-publication acceptance must access the actual site URL. `post_deploy()`"
" reads the manifest, checksum file and every inventoried payload over "
"HTTP(S), compares against externally saved digests, and verifies actual "
"downloaded bytes and packaged links. By default it checks that stable "
"selects this version; when an archive digest is supplied it also checks the "
"download entry and the complete downloaded archive closure. Success writes "
"an independent receipt recording each requested URL, final URL, status, "
"bytes and digest. Local HTTP verification does not replace public-site "
"acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:153
msgid ""
"新验收开始前，工具将自己拥有的旧 receipt 标为 `running`。失败写入 `failed`， 不能留下上次的 `verified` "
"冒充本次成功；无关文件和 symlink 不能作为 receipt。"
msgstr ""
"Before a new acceptance run, the tool marks its owned prior receipt as "
"`running`. Failure writes `failed`; a prior `verified` cannot remain as a "
"false current success. Unrelated files and symlinks cannot act as receipts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:156
msgid ""
"历史不可变版本不一定是当前 stable。仅验证历史版本时可以显式设置 `verify_stable=False`，receipt 同时记录未检查 "
"stable，不能作为最新发布入口的验收。"
msgstr ""
"An immutable historical version need not be current stable. For historical "
"verification only, set `verify_stable=False` explicitly; the receipt also "
"records that stable was not checked and cannot establish acceptance of the "
"latest publication entry."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:159
msgid "长期保留与退出条件"
msgstr "Long-term retention and exit conditions"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:161
msgid ""
"远程发布保留不可变文档归档、归档与 manifest 摘要、精确源码身份和恢复 receipt。 "
"交付者需实际上传、重新下载、校验并恢复；“配置了上传”不等于“完成长期存储”。 "
"第二个独立根目录恢复后，检查语言入口、API、图示和许可，使用实际文件记录结果。"
msgstr ""
"Remote publication retains the immutable documentation archive, archive and "
"manifest digests, exact source identity and restoration receipt. The "
"deliverer must actually upload, download again, verify and restore: "
"configured upload is not completed long-term storage. After restoration into"
" a second independent root, check language entries, API, diagrams and "
"licenses, and record results against actual files."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:165
msgid ""
"文档发行说明可以指向 Release 附件，也可以指向独立资产分支的不可变 Git commit。 "
"取得性以实际成功的渠道为准：附件上传失败不能写成附件已发布。Git 渠道必须使用 包含完整 commit 的下载地址，记录准确 "
"path／bytes／SHA-256；可变分支名只作发现 入口。超过单文件上限的工具或证据归档分片保存，每片不超过 32 MiB，另附有序 "
"分片表及整包摘要。下载全部分片后真实重组、核对整包并逐成员验真，才建立恢复 结果。原发行 commit 和既有版本目录保留；后续证据新增独立路径或 "
"commit，不覆盖 同身份归档。保留这些对象不能自动保证服务商永不删除，维护者仍需按下载说明 保留独立副本。"
msgstr ""
"Documentation release notes may point to Release assets or an immutable Git "
"commit on an independent assets branch. Availability depends on the channel "
"that actually succeeded: a failed asset upload cannot be reported as a "
"published asset. Git downloads must include the full commit and exact "
"path/bytes/SHA-256; mutable branch names are discovery entries only. Tool or"
" evidence archives exceeding the per-file limit are stored in ordered parts "
"no larger than 32 MiB, with a full-archive digest. Restoration is "
"established only after all parts are downloaded, actually reassembled, "
"checked as a whole and verified member by member. Preserve original release "
"commits and existing version directories; later evidence adds independent "
"paths or commits instead of replacing same-identity archives. Retention "
"cannot guarantee that a provider never deletes objects; maintainers still "
"keep independent copies according to the download instructions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/reference/documentation-delivery.md:174
msgid ""
"软件工具回归使用 stdlib `unittest`，覆盖脏／陈旧源码、缺失入口、内容篡改、路径 逃逸、链接成员、同身份冲突、独立恢复、真实 HTTP "
"成功与篡改拒绝。新的回归执行 不能继承历史测试数量。没有实板执行的物理状态始终保留为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Software-tool regressions use stdlib `unittest` and cover dirty/stale "
"source, missing entries, content tampering, directory escape, link members, "
"same-identity conflicts, independent restoration, and actual HTTP success "
"and tamper rejection. New regression executions do not inherit historical "
"test counts. Without physical execution, physical status always remains "
"`not_executed`."
